  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of solar mini-grid projects  in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is under Norad&apos;s Enterprise for Development Scheme (EDFJ). Norad supports development of solar mini-grid projects in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC). This includes projects in Bumba, Gemena and Isiro as well as projects within the buffer zone of the Maiko Natural Park. 

Among others, Norad&apos;s support covers costs associated with setting up company structures, technical studies, financing, legal fees and site permits.</narrative>
  </description>
